    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Death's Web&quot; is a challenging &quot;Rogue-lite&quot; platformer where you explore an ever-changing 2D world filled with enemies ready to slay you. Fight, die, learn repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collector of Souls</strong>: You posess the ability to steal enemies souls after they die. you can secure the souls through soul spheres and use them after death to permanently increase your stats and upgrade spells.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curses:</strong> Numerous curses are waiting to be discovered; they may lead to your demise, but they can be exchanged for blessings to aid your journey. Survive their devastating effects to claim your rewards. Curses can blind you, summon deadly spikes, unleash freezing hail, and much more\u2014each one a unique challenge to overcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/70bdf490761390adb413db177e0139ad.poster.avif?t=1749982437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/70bdf490761390adb413db177e0139ad.webm?t=1749982437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/70bdf490761390adb413db177e0139ad.mp4?t=1749982437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessings: Some will heal you, others grant powerful new abilities, and some can completely absorb incoming damage. They enhance gameplay with unique effects, making each run more dynamic and engaging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/d6abbff3db4f54df8c953d0dcd5c10a3.poster.avif?t=1749982437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/d6abbff3db4f54df8c953d0dcd5c10a3.webm?t=1749982437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/d6abbff3db4f54df8c953d0dcd5c10a3.mp4?t=1749982437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Traverse diverse biomes teeming with unique, formidable enemies. They may seem insurmountable at first, but with every death, you gain the experience needed to overcome them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/baf7afe49f42480bd7654325b380c7a8.poster.avif?t=1749982437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/baf7afe49f42480bd7654325b380c7a8.webm?t=1749982437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/baf7afe49f42480bd7654325b380c7a8.mp4?t=1749982437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cities:</strong> Discover cities where you can delve into the lore of the world, learn about spells, and enhance your weapons and stats through <strong>temporary upgrades</strong> available in local stores. You can also dive deep into the <strong>story</strong> of the blessed lands and learn about it's people and history. They might give you something useful or they might ask you to help them but  whether to help them or not is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/e802d024c513847234ef0bc7a3640582.poster.avif?t=1749982437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/e802d024c513847234ef0bc7a3640582.webm?t=1749982437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/e802d024c513847234ef0bc7a3640582.mp4?t=1749982437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Death's Web&quot; is a challenging &quot;Rogue-lite&quot; platformer where you explore an ever-changing 2D world filled with enemies ready to slay you. Fight, die, learn repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collector of Souls</strong>: You posess the ability to steal enemies souls after they die. you can secure the souls through soul spheres and use them after death to permanently increase your stats and upgrade spells.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curses:</strong> Numerous curses are waiting to be discovered; they may lead to your demise, but they can be exchanged for blessings to aid your journey. Survive their devastating effects to claim your rewards. Curses can blind you, summon deadly spikes, unleash freezing hail, and much more\u2014each one a unique challenge to overcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/70bdf490761390adb413db177e0139ad.poster.avif?t=1749982437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/70bdf490761390adb413db177e0139ad.webm?t=1749982437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/70bdf490761390adb413db177e0139ad.mp4?t=1749982437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessings: Some will heal you, others grant powerful new abilities, and some can completely absorb incoming damage. They enhance gameplay with unique effects, making each run more dynamic and engaging!</p><p class=\